### 1. Assessment of Investment Strategy Effectiveness

**Discussion Points:**
- Sarah Thompson provided an update on the investment portfolio, which reportedly has a total value of $450 million as of October 1, 2023, indicating a decline from previous assessments. The portfolio is noted to be overly concentrated in equities (80%) with only minor allocations to fixed income (15%) and alternative investments (5%).
- The equity section was criticized for heavy investments in technology (60%), which has underperformed recently, showing an average return of -5% year-to-date, which detracted from overall performance. Emily Chen raised concerns about the overreliance on tech sector performance.

**Action Items:**
- Emily Chen was tasked with conducting a comprehensive analysis of the underperformance of equity holdings, specifically within the tech sector, to be presented at the next meeting scheduled for November 15, 2023.
- Robert Green was assigned to develop a risk mitigation plan addressing the concentrated equity exposure by November 10, 2023.

